Description: Ship Cargo.lock with rustls 0.23.46
 rustls 0.23.43, the TLS stack behind every HTTPS request, is affected by
 RUSTSEC-2026-0349 (a ServerHello can downgrade later connections to
 classical key exchange) and RUSTSEC-2026-0285 (TLS 1.3 handshake messages
 accepted across encryption levels), plus two that need code paths this
 build does not use. 0.23.46 is semver-compatible and also moves aws-lc-rs,
 aws-lc-sys and rustls-webpki. crossbeam-epoch goes to 0.9.21 for
 RUSTSEC-2026-0204. This is the lock "cargo update -p rustls" then
 "cargo update -p crossbeam-epoch" produced on top of the previous patch.
Author: pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>
Forwarded: not-yet
Last-Update: 2026-10-20
